ood service."},{"title":"Multi-Property Coordination","description":"Centralized management for hotel groups and resort portfolios. Consistent service standards across all your properties with unified reporting."},{"title":"Sustainability Certifications","description":"Support for LEED, Green Key, and other hospitality sustainability programs. We provide the documentation and diversion rates you need for certification."}],"faqs":[{"question":"How do you ensure service doesn't disrupt guests?","answer":"We schedule pickups during low-traffic hours and position equipment in service areas away from guest sightlines. Our crews are trained in hospitality environment protocols and maintain a professional, unobtrusive presence."},{"question":"Can you handle conference and banquet waste?","answer":"Yes, we provide additional capacity for large events, conferences, and banquets. We work with your events team to pre-position resources and ensure rapid cleanup that supports quick room turnovers."},{"question":"Do you offer cooking oil recycling?","answer":"Absolutely. We provide dedicated cooking oil collection and recycling services for hotel kitchens and restaurants. This keeps grease out of your waste stream and supports sustainable practices."},{"question":"How do you support our sustainability initiatives?","answer":"We help hotels implement recycling programs, track diversion rates, and provide detailed reporting for sustainability certifications. Many of our hotel partners have achieved significant improvements in their environmental metrics."},{"question":"Can you service multiple properties under one agreement?","answer":"Yes, we specialize in multi-property management for hotel groups. You get consistent service standards, unified billing, and a single point of contact for all your properties."}]}],["$L7","$L8","$L9"],"$La"]}],{},null,false,false]},null,false,false]},null,false,false]},null,false,false],"$Lb",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$c",[]],"S":true}
